  "sourceBoundContracts": [
    "Native SwTableLine is a SwClient of SwTableLineFormat; ClaimFrameFormat checks other row clients, copies native attributes before mutation, and moves the claiming row. Exclusive claims reuse the original owner.",
    "lcl_ProcessRowAttr reuses one new format for rows with the same old format in one operation. Native complete SfxPoolItem enters the row item set directly; the represented document owner emits one revision and retains same-value history.",
    "Native SwDoc MakeTableLineFormat derives from the default frame format. Exact aTableLineSetRange includes frame size, row split, vertical orientation and border attributes. Existing concrete frame-size and split defaults come from the document pool.",
    "Native SaveTable AddFormat deduplicates by original format identity, copies direct native items to a standalone item set, stores row indices and reconstructs shared new format owners. The represented history now preserves this sharing topology and complete attributes without retaining text/row graphs.",
    "Native node insertion constructs rows with the source native format. Mounted direct item publication and repeated document Undo/Redo retain original rows/boxes/text/cursor; 12 fresh literal cases and related modules validate this bounded slice.",
    "Full native SwRowFrame registration/retargeting, typed TableLineFormatChanged/MoveTableLine hints and client destruction are not implemented here. Current stateless SwRowFrame reads its original line every time; complete frame client lifecycle remains a following task.",
    "Complete native pooling, all frame attributes, nested/merged table, UNO and model modified flag contracts remain unverified. No whole row/core/browser parity promotion.",
    "Registered IO/recovery/settings and all prior metadata states/defaults/classes preserved; whole core/browser parity incomplete."
  ]
}
